& =t\left(\frac{1-\lambda}{2-\lambda}\right)\left(|\overrightarrow{O Q}|^{2}-|\overrightarrow{O P}|^{2}\right) \\
& =0
\end{aligned}
$$
Thus，$O U$ is perpendicular to $P Q$ ．The claim is agreed．
